Summary table of all variables for the India Time Use Survey 2024 (tus106PER data file), including specifics for Age and Day of the Week as requested:

Variable Name	Type	Format	Range/Min/Max	Categories/Details
Age	Numeric	Continuous	Min: 6, Max: 118, Mean: 35.88	Age of person. Width: 3. Valid: 10,128,216. Invalid: 83,262. ​
Day of the Week	Discrete	Character	1–7	1=Monday, 2=Tuesday, ..., 7=Sunday. Valid: 10,128,216. Each day distributed almost equally. ​
